  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/md78MGbEfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p><h1>Create：錢幣學</h1><p>《錢幣學》是一款全新貨幣模組，不僅提供簡易商店的直覺操作系統，更為您最狂野的紅石資本主義夢想保留發揮空間。</p><h2>特色功能</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/vendor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/creative_vendor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>交易機</h3><p>專為玩家經營的緊湊商店設計，可快速買賣物品。</p><p>創造模式版本允許伺服器管理員設置無限補貨的商店。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/bank_terminal.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>銀行終端機</h3><p>存取您的虛擬銀行帳戶，進行硬幣存提款。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/andesite_depositor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/brass_depositor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>存款機</h3><p>設定價格後，當玩家透過庫存硬幣或使用卡片存款時，存款機將發送1紅石刻脈衝信號。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>硬幣系統</h3><p>本模組的核心基礎，提供6種不同面值的硬幣選擇。</p><table style=\"width:70.5514%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">刺棘幣</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">斜齒幣</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">鏈齒幣</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">齒輪幣</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">皇冠幣</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.3823%\">日耀幣</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">1刺棘</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">8刺棘</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">16刺棘</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">64刺棘</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">8齒輪</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.3823%;text-align:center\">64齒輪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/spur.png\" alt=\"Spur\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/bevel.png\" alt=\"Bevel\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/sprocket.png\" alt=\"Sprocket\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/cog.png\" alt=\"Cog\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/crown.png\" alt=\"Crown\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.3823%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/sun.png\" alt=\"Sun\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/red_card.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/red_id_card.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>銀行卡與身份卡</h3><p>將銀行卡插入存款機或交易機，資金將直接匯入關聯帳戶。此外，在交易機或存款機使用銀行卡時，會從帳戶扣款而非消耗庫存硬幣。</p><p>身份卡用於授權其他玩家存取《錢幣學》的受保護方塊（交易機、存款機與烈焰銀行家），方便您與商業夥伴共享權限。</p><p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/blaze_banker.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p><h3>烈焰銀行家</h3><p>單一銀行帳戶無法滿足您<del>避稅</del>商業需求？創建新帳戶並透過身份卡授權商業夥伴提領資金。</p>",
